<urn:atm:triage:resolution/AY13-QA-004/1>
  a triage:Resolution ;
  triage:resolvedBy "cipher" ;
  triage:resolvedAt "2026-09-07T17:26:47Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:fixCommit "c0afd678d" ;
  triage:fixBranch "feature/ay13-doctor-team-scope" ;
  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1300-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr independently confirmed via git show c0afd678d on doctor_projection.rs: the per-team loop no longer propagates the append_herdr_report error via `?`; append_herdr_report now returns () and checks deadline.expired() before each iteration, calling append_deadline_finding() (pushes a DoctorFinding, preserves the already-built partial report) and breaking the loop instead of erroring out. Confirmed with a personally-run `cargo test -p atm-runtime` (all green, including the new all_team_projection_aggregates_each_roster_through_the_async_loop test) at branch head cb13ca7e38 / current PR head 8ae936a37. Closing on this evidence." .
